  // A field that is PRESENT but null is an empty answer, not an absent
  // field. `entire brain recall` returns `"facts": null` where search
  // returns `"results": []`, and treating null as "no such field" walks
  // past every row field and scores an empty brain as a hit -- the exact
  // false negative this pane exists to prevent. Observed live, not guessed.
  if (!(field in payload)) continue
